[I] API and format for editorial timeline information

[T] Open Source API and interchange format for editorial timeline information.

[U] https://github.com/AcademySoftwareFoundation/OpenTimelineIO

[A] AcademySoftwareFoundation
[M] andrei32 <andrei32.t2@gmail.com>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS OBJDIR

[L] APL
[V] 0.18.1

[D] bf501e68c364a383f427622104f4923576a249a1237de588910a42ce OpenTimelineIO-0.18.1.tar.gz git+https://github.com/AcademySoftwareFoundation/OpenTimelineIO v0.18.1

var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DOTIO_FIND_IMATH=ON
var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DOTIO_FIND_RAPIDJSON=ON

pkginstalled pybind11 && var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DOTIO_PYTHON_INSTALL=ON
pkginstalled python || var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DOTIO_INSTALL_PYTHON_MODULES=OFF
